                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15509155" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 21 Sep 2016 08:07:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Andrey, please review.&lt;br/&gt;
Implemented support for unsigned types for MySQL.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15509688" author="anovikov" created="Wed, 21 Sep 2016 11:55:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good. Alexey, please merge.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15512617" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 22 Sep 2016 08:32:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Pavel, please test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To test:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;create in &lt;b&gt;MySQL&lt;/b&gt; table like this:
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;CREATE TABLE zzz (
  a &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;(11) unsigned,
  b &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;(11)
)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Then in schema import utility import this table.&lt;br/&gt;
Field &quot;a&quot; should be mapped to &lt;b&gt;java.lang.Long&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Field &quot;b&quot; should be mapped to &lt;b&gt;java.lang.Integer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15512909" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 22 Sep 2016 10:35:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
